        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "April 26, 2006 at 5:30 and 8 pm Harp Consorts by William Lawespreceded by two mini-conferences at 5:00 and 7:30: «XVIIth century English Music» by François FiliatraultMaxine Eilander, Harp; David Greenberg, baroque violin; Stephen Stubbs, theorbo; Susie Napper & Margaret Little, bass viols.Crypt of the Chapelle Notre-Dame-de-Bonsecours400, St-Paul East, Montreal, QuebecInformation : 514-223-1186"
