        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tThe Mysterious Viol\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t26 March 2005 : 00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMarch 26, 2005 at 8 pmSusie Napper & Margaret Little, violas da gamba, with members of the Viola da Gamba Societywith the help of the Canada Council for the Arts\nSchool Hall at Monte Sant'Angelo, Mercy College, Miller Street, North Sydney, AustraliaInformation : +61 2 9419 7473 “””\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 26 March 2005 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Concert, Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 26 March 2005 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Concert, Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« Folies\n\t\t\tPastoral Love »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
