    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "January 23, 2008 at 7:30 pmCelebrate Mardi Gras with Les Voix Baroques et Les Voix Humaines!Under the direction of Luca Guglielmi, harpsichordLes Voix baroques:Suzie LeBlanc & Catherine Webster, sopranos, Matthew White, alto,Charles Daniels & Colin Balzer, ténors, Sumner Thompson, basseLes Voix humaines:Olivier Brault & Geneviève Gilardeau, violinsSusie Napper, Margaret Little & Elin Söderström, violas da gambaSara Lackie, harp, Sylvain Bergeron, lute and guitare,Matt Jennejohn, cornetto, Patrick Graham, percussion CBC McGillRedpath Hall, McGill University3461 McTavish, MontrealInformation:: (514) 398-4547with the help of the Canada Council for the Arts"
      }
    ],
