    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tA VENETIAN CARNIVAL\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t23 January 2008 : 00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJanuary 23, 2008 at 7:30 pmCelebrate Mardi Gras with Les Voix Baroques et Les Voix Humaines!\nUnder the direction of Luca Guglielmi, harpsichord\nLes Voix baroques:Suzie LeBlanc & Catherine Webster, sopranos, Matthew White, alto,Charles Daniels & Colin Balzer, ténors, Sumner Thompson, basse\nLes Voix humaines:Olivier Brault & Geneviève Gilardeau, violinsSusie Napper, Margaret Little & Elin Söderström, violas da gambaSara Lackie, harp, Sylvain Bergeron, lute and guitare,Matt Jennejohn, cornetto, Patrick Graham, percussion \nCBC McGillRedpath Hall, McGill University3461 McTavish, MontrealInformation:: (514) 398-4547with the help of the Canada Council for the Arts  “””\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 23 January 2008 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Concert, Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 23 January 2008 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Concert, Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« The Sun Queen\n\t\t\tSAINTE-COLOMBE & MARIN MARAIS : MASTER AND PUPIL »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
