        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "<p><span class=\"emphase\"><span class=\"\"emphase\"\">Sainte-Colombe, Leb&egrave;gue, Rameau, Couperin, Corrette,<br/>Marais, WF Bach, Telemann, Boismortier, Vivaldi<br/></span></span>Susie Napper et Margaret Little, violes de gambe<br/>23 mars 2011 &agrave; 20h15<br/><br/>Oude Muziek<br/>Loevestein Castle <br/>Loevestein 1, 5307 TG Poederoijen<br/>Renseignements: <a href=\"\"http://www.oudemuziek.nl/\"\">http://www.oudemuziek.nl/</a></p></span>"
