    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "<p>SEPT CONCERTS &agrave; Paradyzu et autres localit&eacute;s adjacentes en Pologne &ndash; Ao&ucirc;t 2012<br /><br />Susie Napper et Margaret Little, violes de gambe</p><p class=normal\"><strong>MUSICKE &amp; MIRTH</strong> - 13 ao&ucirc;t<br />Hume, Simpson, Byrd, Jenkins, Finger, Telemann<br />Galeria BWA, Zielona G&oacute;ra<br /><a href=\"\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07CX6m3V4PA&amp;feature=player_embedded\"\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07CX6m3V4PA&amp;feature=player_embedded</a></p><p><strong>MUSICK &amp; MIRTH</strong> - 14 ao&ucirc;t<br /><span class=\"\"emphase\"\">Hume, Simpson, Byrd, Jenkins, Finger, Telemann</span><br />Biblioteka Augustia&#324;ska, &#379;aga&#324;<br /><a href=\"\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v4vxcrfLdpo&amp;feature=player_embedded\"\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v4vxcrfLdpo&amp;feature=player_embedded</a></p><p><strong>THE FOUR SEASONS</strong> &ndash; Christopher Simpson - 17 ao&ucirc;t &agrave; 20h - Paradyzu<br />avec Davide Monti, violon, et Maria Cleary, harpe, <span class=\"\"userContent\"\">Joanna Bo&#347;lak-G&oacute;rniok</span>, clavecin<br /><a href=\"\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AZ2EmKb8SZU&amp;feature=player_embedded\"\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AZ2EmKb8SZU&amp;feature=player_embedded</a></p><p><strong>MUSICKE &amp; MIRTH</strong> - 18 ao&ucirc;t &agrave; 20h - Paradyzu<br /><span class=\"\"emphase\"\">Hume, Simpson, Byrd, Jenkins, Finger</span><br /><a href=\"\"http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-18\"\">http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-18</a>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"\"normal\"\"><strong>LES TENDRES REGRETS</strong> - 19 ao&ucirc;t &agrave; 21h30 &ndash; Paradyzu<br /><span class=\"\"emphase\"\">Concerts &agrave; deux violes esgales de Sainte-Colombe</span><br /><a href=\"\"http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-19\"\">http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-19</a></p><p class=\"\"normal\"\"><strong>L&rsquo;ALTRO MONDO</strong> - 20 ao&ucirc;t &agrave; 20h - Paradyzu<br />avec l&rsquo;Ensemble Paradyz en r&eacute;sidence<a href=\"\"http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-20\"\"><br />http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-20</a></p><p class=\"\"normal\"\"><strong>LES SAISONS</strong> de Vivaldi &amp; Ch&eacute;deville - 21 ao&ucirc;t &agrave; 20h - Paradyzu<br />avec l&rsquo;Ensemble Paradyz en r&eacute;sidence<a href=\"\"http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-21\"\"><br />http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-21</a><br /><br />Parady&#380;u, Pologne<br /><span class=\"\"normal\"\">Renseignements&nbsp;: </span><a href=\"\"http://www.muzykawraju.pl\"\">http://www.muzykawraju.pl</a><br /><span class=\"hautcalendrier\">avec l&#39;aide du Conseil des arts et des lettres du Qu&eacute;bec</span></p></span>"
      }
    ]
  },
