      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "SEVEN CONCERTS in Paradyzu and close-by towns - August 2012 Susie Napper & Margaret Little, violas da gamba  MUSICKE & MIRTH – August 13Hume, Simpson, Byrd, Jenkins, Finger, TelemannGaleria BWA, Zielona Górahttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07CX6m3V4PA&feature=player_embeddedMUSICKE & MIRTH – August 14Hume, Simpson, Byrd, Jenkins, Finger, TelemannBiblioteka Augustiańska, Żagańhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v4vxcrfLdpo&feature=player_embeddedTHE SEASONS – CHRISTOPHER SIMPSON - August 17 at 8 pm - Paradyzuwith Davide Monti, violin, Maria Cleary, harp, Joanna Boślak-Górniok, harpsichordhttp://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-17http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AZ2EmKb8SZU&feature=player_embeddedMUSICKE & MIRTH - August 18 at 8 pm - ParadyzuHume, Simpson, Byrd, Jenkins, Fingerhttp://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-18LES TENDRES REGRETS - August 19 at 9 :30 pm – Paradyzu« Concerts a deux violes esgales » by Sainte-Colombehttp://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-19L'ALTRO MONDO - August 20 at 8 pm - Paradyzuwith Paradyz Residency Ensemblehttp://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-20VIVALDI & CHÉDEVILLES' SEASONS – August 21 at 8 pm - Paradyzuwith Paradyz Residency Ensemblehttp://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-21 Paradyżu, PolandInformation : http://www.muzykawraju.plwith the help of the Conseil des arts et des lettres du Québec"
