        "@value": "RESIDENCY AT MUZYKA W RAJU (Music in Paradise)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>SEVEN CONCERTS in Paradyzu and close-by towns - August 2012<br /> Susie Napper &amp; Margaret Little, violas da gamba <br /> <br /> <strong>MUSICKE &amp; MIRTH</strong> &ndash; August 13<br /><span class=\"emphase\">Hume, Simpson, Byrd, Jenkins, Finger, Telemann</span><br />Galeria BWA, Zielona G&oacute;ra<br /><a href=\"\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07CX6m3V4PA&amp;feature=player_embedded\"\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07CX6m3V4PA&amp;feature=player_embedded</a></p><p><strong>MUSICKE &amp; MIRTH</strong>&nbsp;&ndash; August 14<br /><span class=\"\"emphase\"\">Hume, Simpson, Byrd, Jenkins, Finger, Telemann</span><br />Biblioteka Augustia&#324;ska, &#379;aga&#324;<br /><a href=\"\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v4vxcrfLdpo&amp;feature=player_embedded\"\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v4vxcrfLdpo&amp;feature=player_embedded</a></p><p><strong>THE SEASONS &ndash; CHRISTOPHER SIMPSON</strong> - August 17 at 8 pm - Paradyzu<br />with Davide Monti, violin, Maria Cleary, harp, <span class=\"\"userContent\"\">Joanna Bo&#347;lak-G&oacute;rniok</span>, harpsichord<br /><a href=\"\"http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-17\"\">http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-17</a><a href=\"\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AZ2EmKb8SZU&amp;feature=player_embedded\"\">http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AZ2EmKb8SZU&amp;feature=player_embedded</a></p><p><strong>MUSICKE &amp; MIRTH</strong>&nbsp;- August 18 at 8 pm - Paradyzu<br /><span class=\"\"emphase\"\">Hume, Simpson, Byrd, Jenkins, Finger</span><br /><a href=\"\"http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-18\"\">http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-18</a></p><p><strong>LES TENDRES REGRETS</strong> - August 19 at 9&nbsp;:30 pm &ndash; Paradyzu<br /><span class=\"\"emphase\"\">&laquo;&nbsp;Concerts a deux violes esgales&nbsp;&raquo; by Sainte-Colombe</span><br /><a href=\"\"http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-19\"\">http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-19</a></p><p><strong>L&#39;ALTRO MONDO</strong> - August 20 at 8 pm - Paradyzu<br />with Paradyz Residency Ensemble<br /><a href=\"\"http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-20\"\">http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-20</a></p><p class=\"\"normal\"\"><strong>VIVALDI &amp; CH&Eacute;DEVILLES&#39; SEASONS</strong> &ndash; August 21 at 8 pm - Paradyzu<br />with Paradyz Residency Ensemble<br /><a href=\"\"http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-21\"\">http://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-21</a><br /><br /> <span class=\"\"normal\"\">Parady&#380;u, Poland<br />Information&nbsp;: </span><a href=\"\"http://www.muzykawraju.pl\"\">http://www.muzykawraju.pl</a><br /><span class=\"hautcalendrier\">with the help of the Conseil des arts et des lettres du Qu&eacute;bec</span></p></span>"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
