      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tRESIDENCY AT MUZYKA W RAJU (Music in Paradise)\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t13 August 2012 : 00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSEVEN CONCERTS in Paradyzu and close-by towns – August 2012 Susie Napper & Margaret Little, violas da gamba \n MUSICKE & MIRTH – August 13Hume, Simpson, Byrd, Jenkins, Finger, TelemannGaleria BWA, Zielona Górahttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=07CX6m3V4PA&feature=player_embedded\nMUSICKE & MIRTH – August 14Hume, Simpson, Byrd, Jenkins, Finger, TelemannBiblioteka Augustiańska, Żagańhttp://www.youtube.com/watch?v=v4vxcrfLdpo&feature=player_embedded\nTHE SEASONS – CHRISTOPHER SIMPSON – August 17 at 8 pm – Paradyzuwith Davide Monti, violin, Maria Cleary, harp, Joanna Boślak-Górniok, harpsichordhttp://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-17http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AZ2EmKb8SZU&feature=player_embedded\nMUSICKE & MIRTH – August 18 at 8 pm – ParadyzuHume, Simpson, Byrd, Jenkins, Fingerhttp://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-18\nLES TENDRES REGRETS – August 19 at 9 :30 pm – Paradyzu« Concerts a deux violes esgales » by Sainte-Colombehttp://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-19\nL'ALTRO MONDO – August 20 at 8 pm – Paradyzuwith Paradyz Residency Ensemblehttp://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-20\nVIVALDI & CHÉDEVILLES' SEASONS – August 21 at 8 pm – Paradyzuwith Paradyz Residency Ensemblehttp://www.muzykawraju.pl/program/2012-08-21\n Paradyżu, PolandInformation : http://www.muzykawraju.plwith the help of the Conseil des arts et des lettres du Québec\n“””\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 13 August 2012 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Concert, Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 13 August 2012 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Concert, Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« TRUMPETS OF THE APOCALYPSE\n\t\t\tMUSIC & MIRTH »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
