    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "TRUMPETS OF THE APOCALYPSE"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p class=normal\">Montreal premiere! A celebration of the natural trumpet with two European stars,<br />Les Voix Humaines and violins, a sackbut and timpani.<br /><span class=\"\"emphase\"\">Biber, Schmeltzer, Rosenm&uuml;ller<br /></span>Les Voix humaines Consort<br />Jean-Francois Madeuf (France) and Graham Nicholson (Holland), trumpets<br />June 22, 2012 at 7:30 pm<br /><br /><span class=\"\"normal\"\">Festival Montr&eacute;al Baroque<br />Cours d&#39;Appel du Qu&eacute;bec &agrave; Montr&eacute;al<br />&Eacute;difice Ernest-Cormier. 100, rue Notre-Dame Est, Montr&eacute;al<br />Information&nbsp;: 514- 845 7171 - </span><a href=\"\"http://www.montrealbaroque.com\"\">www.montrealbaroque.com</a></p></span>"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://lesvoixhumaines.org/temporary/8258596a-4ad8-4f51-ae6a-d2db87995b9e",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/WebPage"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://lesvoixhumaines.org/en/evenement/trumpets-of-the-apocalypse/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tTRUMPETS OF THE APOCALYPSE\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t22 June 2012 : 00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tMontreal premiere! A celebration of the natural trumpet with two European stars,Les Voix Humaines and violins, a sackbut and timpani.Biber, Schmeltzer, RosenmüllerLes Voix humaines ConsortJean-Francois Madeuf (France) and Graham Nicholson (Holland), trumpetsJune 22, 2012 at 7:30 pm\nFestival Montréal BaroqueCours d'Appel du Québec à MontréalÉdifice Ernest-Cormier. 100, rue Notre-Dame Est, MontréalInformation : 514- 845 7171 – www.montrealbaroque.com\n“””\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 22 June 2012 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Concert, Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 22 June 2012 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Concert, Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« SUMMERTIME\n\t\t\tRESIDENCY AT MUZYKA W RAJU (Music in Paradise) »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
