    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Henry & William Lawes, Purcell, Simpson & Jenkins Charles Daniels, tenor, Sylvain Bergeron, lute, Susie Napper & Margaret Little, violas da gamba January 16, 2013 at 8 pm  Salle d'Youville, Société du Palais Montcalm, Québec Information : Société duPalais Montcalmwith the help of the  Conseil des arts et des lettres du Québecand the Canada Council for the Arts"
