    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tPERCHANCE TO DREAME\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t4 February 2014 : 00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHenry & William Lawes, Purcell, Simpson & Jenkins Charles Daniels, tenor, Sylvain Bergeron, lute,Susie Napper & Margaret Little, violas da gambaFebruary 4, 2014 at 8 pm\nCrescent Fort Rouge United Church525 Wardlaw Avenue & Nassau Street N. Winnipeg, Manitobahttp://www.cameratanova.com/12/\nwith the help of the Conseil des arts et des lettres du Québec and the Canada Council for the Arts\n“””\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 4 February 2014 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Concert, Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 4 February 2014 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Concert, Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« PERCHANCE TO DREAME\n\t\t\tPERCHANCE TO DREAME »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
