        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "RESIDENCY AT MUZYKA W RAJU (Music in Paradise)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p class=titre\">SEVEN CONCERTS in Paradyzu - August 2013<br /> <span class=\"\"emphase\"\">Susie Napper &amp; Margaret Little, violas da gamba</span></p><p class=\"\"Normal1\"\"><b class=\"\"emphase\"\">MUSICALL HUMORS</b> - August 17, 2013<br />Songs and dances by Tobias Hume<br />with vocal soloists and the<strong> Paradyz Ensemble in residence</strong></p><p><b class=\"\"emphase\"\">FOLIES</b> &ndash; August 19, 2013<br />Rameau, Marais, Sainte-Colombe, Couperin, Corrette<br />Les Voix humaines duo</p><p class=\"\"Normal1\"\"><b class=\"\"emphase\"\">GERMAN MUSIC FROM THE 17th CENTURY</b> &ndash; August 20, 2013<br />with The Ground Floor</p><p class=\"\"Normal1\"\"><b class=\"\"emphase\"\">FESTIVE VIOLS</b>&nbsp; - August 21, 2013<br />Solos, duos and viol consorts &ndash; Sainte-Colombe, Marais, Geoffroy, Du Caurroy &amp; Moulini&eacute;<br />with Romina Lischka &amp; Teodoro Bau, viols, and Joanna Bo&#347;lak-G&oacute;rniok, harpsichord</p><p><b class=\"\"emphase\"\">FANTASIA</b> - August 23, 2013<br />Lupo, Gibbons, Byrd, Jenkins, Lawes, Coleman<br />consort of viols with &nbsp;Romina Lischka &amp; Teodoro Bau</p><p class=\"\"Normal1\"\"><b class=\"\"emphase\"\">STROZZI</b> - August 23, 2013,<br />Harp recital by Maria Cleary<br />with the viol consort (Les Voix humaines, Romina Lischka &amp; Teodoro Bau)</p><p class=\"\"Normal1\"\"><b class=\"\"emphase\"\">TELEMANN</b> - August 24, 2013<br />Telemann&nbsp;concert with all Paradyz artists in residence</p><p>Paradyzu, Pologne<br />Information&nbsp;<tt>: <a class=\"\"normal\"\" href=\"\"http://www.muzykawraju.pl\"\">http://www.muzykawraju.pl</a></tt><br /><tt><span style=\"\"font-size: 10px;\"\">with the help of the Conseil des arts et des lettres du Qu&eacute;bec</span></tt></p></span>"
      }
    ]
  },
