      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tRESIDENCY AT MUZYKA W RAJU (Music in Paradise)\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t17 August 2013 : 00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSEVEN CONCERTS in Paradyzu – August 2013 Susie Napper & Margaret Little, violas da gamba\nMUSICALL HUMORS – August 17, 2013Songs and dances by Tobias Humewith vocal soloists and the Paradyz Ensemble in residence\nFOLIES – August 19, 2013Rameau, Marais, Sainte-Colombe, Couperin, CorretteLes Voix humaines duo\nGERMAN MUSIC FROM THE 17th CENTURY – August 20, 2013with The Ground Floor\nFESTIVE VIOLS  – August 21, 2013Solos, duos and viol consorts – Sainte-Colombe, Marais, Geoffroy, Du Caurroy & Mouliniéwith Romina Lischka & Teodoro Bau, viols, and Joanna Boślak-Górniok, harpsichord\nFANTASIA – August 23, 2013Lupo, Gibbons, Byrd, Jenkins, Lawes, Colemanconsort of viols with  Romina Lischka & Teodoro Bau\nSTROZZI – August 23, 2013,Harp recital by Maria Clearywith the viol consort (Les Voix humaines, Romina Lischka & Teodoro Bau)\nTELEMANN – August 24, 2013Telemann concert with all Paradyz artists in residence\nParadyzu, PologneInformation : http://www.muzykawraju.plwith the help of the Conseil des arts et des lettres du Québec\n“””\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 17 August 2013 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Concert, Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 17 August 2013 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t00:00 - 02:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Categories: Concert, Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« SUMMERTIME\n\t\t\tLA REINE SOLEIL »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
