        "@value": "<p><span class=\"emphase\">Bach, Lupo, Purcell, Byrd, etc.</span><br />Les Voix humaines Consort of Viols :<br />Margaret Little, M&eacute;lisande Corriveau, Felix Deak &amp; Susie Napper<br />June 8, 2014 at 11 am</p><p>Tage Alter Musik<br />Reichssaal, Rathausplatz, Regensburg, Allemagne<br /><span class=\"\"petit\"\">with the help of the Conseil des arts de Montr&eacute;al and the Conseil des arts et des lettres du Qu&eacute;bec</span></p></span>"
