        "@value": "<p><span class=\"emphase\">Tobias Hume</span><br />Les Voix Humaines Consort, Michael Taylor, tenor, and Nigel North, lute<br />June 27, 2015 at 9 pm</p><p><a href=\"\"http://www.montrealbaroque.com/index.php?vMenu=335&amp;vOptions=liste|concerts\"\">Festival Montr&eacute;al Baroque</a><br />Salle Redpath, Montr&eacute;al</p></span>"
