        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tThe Art of the Fugue\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t24 November 2017\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tComplete version of Bach’s Art of the FugueLes Voix humaines Consort of viols : Margaret Little, Mélisande Corriveau, Felix Deak & Susie Napper\nWith the generous help of the Canada Council for the Arts\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 24 November 2017 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\tEvent Tags:concert\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t http://www.music.lv/bachfestival/en/index.asp?pageId=1537&subPageId=2587&pageAction=showSubPage \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tBach Chamber Music Festival\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\thttp://www.music.lv/bachfestival/\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Small Guild Hall \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\nAmatu 5\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tRiga,\n\n\n\n\tLettonie\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 24 November 2017 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\tEvent Tags:concert\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t http://www.music.lv/bachfestival/en/index.asp?pageId=1537&subPageId=2587&pageAction=showSubPage \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tBach Chamber Music Festival\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t