        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tAmour Cruel\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t16 July 2017 : 14:00 - 15:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tLambert, Le Camus, Purcell, Sainte-Colombe, Marais, Simpson, Jenkins & Hume Andréanne Paquin, soprano Susie Napper & Margaret Little, bass viols\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 16 July 2017 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t14:00 - 15:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\tEvent Tags:concert\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://musicandbeyond.ca/fr/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tMusic & Beyond\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\thttps://musicandbeyond.ca/fr/\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Church of St. Barnabas, Apostle and Martyr \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n70 St. James Street (at Kent St.)\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tOttawa,\n\n\tOn\n\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://musicandbeyond.ca/venue/church-of-st-barnabus-apostle-and-martyr/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 16 July 2017 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t14:00 - 15:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\tEvent Tags:concert\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://musicandbeyond.ca/fr/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrgan