        "@value": "War &#038; Teares"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>John Dowland’s Seven Lachrimae and battle music (Jenkins, Lawes, Hume, Holborne)</p>\r\n<p>Nigel North, lute, and Les Voix humaines Consort of Viols :<br /> Margaret Little, Mélisande Corriveau, Felix Deak, Susie Napper, Rafael Sanchez-Guevara, violes</p>\r\n<p><em>with the generous support of the Conseil des Arts et des Lettres du Québec</em><img class=\" wp-image-15208 alignright\" src=\"https://lesvoixhumaines.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/Calq_cyan-300x133.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"185\" height=\"82\" /></p>"
      }
    ]
