        "@value": "<p>Brevis Choir &amp; Consort, Susie Napper &amp; Margaret Little, violas da gamba<br /> 17th century Lutheran Music</p>\r\n<p><em>with the generous support of the Conseil des Arts et des Lettres du Québec</em></p>\r\n<p><img class=\"alignleft  wp-image-15208\" src=\"https://lesvoixhumaines.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/04/Calq_cyan-300x133.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"217\" height=\"96\" /></p>"
