        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tBelief, Disbelief, Death and Transfiguration\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t14 June 2019 : 20:30 - 22:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSainte-Colombe : The Art of the Viola da gamba\nSusie Napper & Margaret Little, violas da gamba\nThéâtre 121 de l’Institut français du Maroc\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 14 June 2019 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t20:30 - 22:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.facebook.com/institutfrancaisdecasablanca/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Théâtre 121 \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n121 boulevard Mohamed Zerktouni\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tCasablanca,\n\n\n\t20 000\n\n\tMaroc\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t +212 (0)5 22 77 98 70 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://if-maroc.org/casablanca/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 14 June 2019 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t20:30 - 22:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.facebook.com/institutfrancaisdecasablanca/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Théâtre 121 \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n121 boulevard Mohamed Zerktouni\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tCasablanca,\n\n\n\t20 000\n\n\tMaroc\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t