        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tLachrimae\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t28 October 2019 : 19:30 - 21:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tJohn Dowland’s “Lachrimae or Seven Teares”\n\nThe programme includes a new piece by Stacey Brown for 5 viols : Lachrimae & Galiard, commissioned by Early Music Vancouver for Les Voix humaines.\nPre-concert lecture at 6 :45 pm\nWith Nigel North, luth, and Les Voix humaines Cosnort of Viols :\nMélisande Corriveau, Margaret Little, Felix Deak, Marie-Laurence Primeau & Susie Napper\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 28 October 2019 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:30 - 21:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t http://artspring.ca \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tLes Voix humaines\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t ArtSpring – Salt Spring’s Centre for the Arts \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n100 Jackson Ave\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tCAPITAL, SUBD. A,\n\n\tBC\n\n\tV8K 2V8\n\n\tCA\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 28 October 2019 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:30 - 21:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t http://artspring.ca \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tLes Voix hum