        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tBelief, Disbelief, Death and Transfiguration\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t15 June 2019 : 19:00 - 20:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tSainte-Colombe : The Art of the Viola da gamba\nSusie Napper & Margaret Little, violas da gamba\nSalle Gérard Philippe de l’Institut français du Maroc\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 15 June 2019 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:00 - 20:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.facebook.com/InstitutfrancaisRabat/posts/prochain-film-%C3%A0-la-salle-g%C3%A9rard-philipe-de-linstitut-fran%C3%A7ais-de-rabat-dimanche-/1808706762551025/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Salle Gérard Philippe de l’Institut français du Maroc \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n2 Rue Al Yanboua\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tRabat,\n\n\n\n\tMaroc\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t +212 5376-89650 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://if-maroc.org/rabat/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 15 June 2019 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:00 - 20:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.facebook.com/InstitutfrancaisRabat/posts/prochain-film-%C3%A0-la-salle-g%C3%A9rard-philipe-de-linstitut-fran%C3%A7ais-de-rabat-dimanche-/180870676255