        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tHygge\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t5 February 2020 : 19:30 - 21:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTelemann : works for flute and viols\nMika Putterman, flute, Susie Napper & Margaret Little, violas da gamba\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 5 February 2020 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:30 - 21:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/hygge-tickets-70912373819 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tAutour de la Flûte\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tEmail:\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tMIKA@AUTOURDELAFLUTE.COM\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\thttp://autourdelaflute.com/\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Concert au Salon à NDG \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n4710 Ch. Circle\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMontréal,\n\n\tQuébec\n\n\tH3W 1Z1\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t 514-909-9037 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t http://autourdelaflute.com/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 5 February 2020 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:30 - 21:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/hygge-tickets-70912373819 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\