        "@value": "<strong>John Dowland’s “Lachrimae or Seven Teares”\r\n</strong>\r\nPre-concert lecture at 1&nbsp;:30 pm\r\n\r\nWith Nigel North, lute, and Les Voix humaines Consort of Viols :\r\nMélisande Corriveau, Margaret Little, Felix Deak, Marie-Laurence Primeau &amp; Susie Napper\r\n\r\n<strong>The Coast Recital Society</strong>"
      }
    ]
