        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tEolo e Orfeo\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t29 February 2020 : 20:00 - 21:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWorks of the Italian Renaissance as well as a new creation for four recorders and four viola da gambas by Montreal composer François-Hugues Leclair.\nFlûte Alors! (Vincent Lauzer, Caroline Tremblay, Marie-Laurence Primeau & Alexa Raine-Wright), Les Voix humaines Consort of Viols (Margaret Little, Mélisande Corriveau, Felix Deak et Susie Napper), Sylvain Bergeron, lute, and Antoine Malette-Chénier, triple harp.\nPresented by Flûte Alors!\n \n  \n \t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 29 February 2020 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t20:00 - 21:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t http://flutealors.com/concerts/serie-montrealaise/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tFlûtes alors !\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tPhone:\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t514· 402· 2363\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tEmail:\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tflutealors@videotron.ca\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\thttp://flutealors.com/\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Chapelle Notre-Dame-de-Bon-Secours \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n400, rue Saint-Paul Est\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tVieux-Montréal,\n\n\tQC\n\n\tH2Y 1H4\n\n\tCA\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 29 February 2020 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t20:00 - 21:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t http://flutealors.com/concerts/serie-montrealaise/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tFlûtes alors !\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tPhone:\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t514· 402· 2363\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tEmail:\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tflutealors@videotron.ca\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\thttp://flutealors.com/\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Chapelle Notre-Dame-de-Bon-Secours \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n400, rue Saint-Paul Est\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tVieux-Montréal,\n\n\tQC\n\n\tH2Y 1H4\n\n\tCA\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« 4 Seasons, 4 Viols\n\t\t\tExtraordinaires de la Chambre du Roy ou l’Anguille du Théâtre d’Eau »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
