        "@language": "en",
        "@value": ""
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://lesvoixhumaines.org/temporary/1a000cfa-fccc-444f-8cce-b6fd2655e5f5",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/WebPage"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://lesvoixhumaines.org/en/evenement/viol-adventure/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tViol adventure – CANCELED\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t9 January 2022 : 16:00 - 17:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tWe regret to inform you that due to the health restrictions imposed by our governments in the face of an increase in the number of COVID-19 cases and variants, we unfortunately have to cancel the long-awaited in-theatre presentation of our production. The health and safety of our artists and of you, our public, remains our priority.\nWe want to assure you that Les Voix humaines will do everything in its power to schedule this production again as soon as possible. \n–\nThe pandemic allowed Susie Napper and Mélisande Corriveau to offer a creation residency to 8 professional musicians. An ideal opportunity to explore the musical universe of the viola da gamba and consort music. Following this residency, we are proud to present the final concert with 2, 3, 4, 5 and 8 viols on stage!\nMusical Program \nBach, Purcell, Dowland, Duarte, Jenkins (etc.)\nInstrumentists \nLaura Andriani\nKyran Assing\nOlivier Brauld\nPierre Cartier\nChloé Dominguez\nJessy Dubé\nMarie Nadeau\nEliana  Zimmerman\n \t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 9 January 2022 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t16:00 - 17:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tLes Voix humaines\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 9 January 2022 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t16:00 - 17:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tLes Voix humaines\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« Extraordinaires de la Chambre du Roy ou l’Anguille du Théâtre d’Eau\n\t\t\tLeonora Isabella Barbara »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
      }
    ]
