    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tLeonora Isabella Barbara\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t24 June 2022 : 19:00 - 20:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHighlighting three brilliant, inspired,17th century composers each with a unique destiny, Leonora Duarte – lady of leisure, Barbara Strozzi – diva, Isabella Leonarda – nun, this concert features the Canadian première of Leonora Duarte’s complete Sinfonias\nProgramme\nSinfonia de Decimitoni – Leonora Duarte (1610-1678)L’Amante segretto – Barbara Strozzi (1619-1677)Sinfonia de Duodesimitoni – Leonora DuartePresso un ruscelloargento – Barbara Strozzi Sinfonia de Primitoni – Leonora DuarteBegle’ochi – Barbara StrozziSinfonia – Seconda Parte – Leonora DuarteL’Amante consolato – Barbara StrozziSonate no10 pour harpe solo – Isabella LeonardaLa riamata da chi amava – Barbara StrozziSinfonia de Seconda toni – Leonora DuarteLa sol fa, mi, re, do – Barbara Strozzi Sinfonia de Otavitoni – Leonora DuarteSinfonia de Tertitoni – Leonora DuarteL’Eraclito amoroso – Barbara Strozzi\nArtists\nJeffrey Thompson, tenor\nConsort Les Voix humaines\nMelisande Corriveau and Jessy Dubé, treble violsFelix Deak, alto violMarie-Laurence Primeau, tenor violSusie Napper, bass violAntoine Malette-Chénier, baroque harpEric Milnes, musical direction and harpsichord\nBUY TICKETS\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 24 June 2022 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:00 - 20:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://montrealbaroque.com/en/2022-edition/leonora-isabella-barbara \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tFestival Montréal Baroque\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\thttps://www.montrealbaroque.com\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Théâtre Rialto \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n5723 avenue du Parc\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMontréal,\n\n\tQuébec\n\n\tH2V 4H2\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t (514) 268-7069 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.theatrerialto.ca/a-propos \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 24 June 2022 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:00 - 20:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://montrealbaroque.com/en/2022-edition/leonora-isabella-barbara \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tFestival Montréal Baroque\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\thttps://www.montrealbaroque.com\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Théâtre Rialto \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n5723 avenue du Parc\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMontréal,\n\n\tQuébec\n\n\tH2V 4H2\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t (514) 268-7069 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.theatrerialto.ca/a-propos \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« Viol adventure – CANCELED\n\t\t\tFlorilège – Huit violes »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
