        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tMeditations – Music for the Royal Chapel of Versailles\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t11 March 2023 : 14:00 - 16:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tContemplative sacred music for the penitential season of Lent, the period of solemn preparation before Easter, featuring vocal and instrumental works by distinguished composers who served at the Court of Louis the XIV.\n \nJanelle Lucyk and Denise Torre Ormeño, sopranos\nKerry Bursey and Philippe Gagné, tenors\nSumner Thompson, baritone\nWilliam Kraushaar, bass\nLes Voix humaines Consort\nMélisande Corriveau, pardessus and bass viol\nJessy Dubé, viola da gamba\nFelix Deak, tenor viol\nSusie Napper, bass viol\nEric Milnes, musical direction and organ \n \nView these beautiful preview videos of some of the repertoire and artists!\n\n\n \n \t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 11 March 2023 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t14:00 - 16:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.tickettailor.com/events/lharmoniedessaisons/815242 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Abbaye Saint-Benoît-du-Lac \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n1 Rue Principale\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSaint-Benoît-du-Lac,\n\n\tQuébec\n\n\tJ0B 2M0\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t (819) 843-4080 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.abbaye.ca/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\