    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tTapestry – Patisserie: A blend of Canadian musical delights\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t4 June 2023 : 14:00 - 15:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInvited by Les Concerts de La Chapelle St Cyriac, Les Voix Humaines Consort will present a new programme reflecting the story of music in Canada after the European settlers arrived on Turtle Island! Viols weathered the stormy seas to be played in New France and beyond. Hear what the early pioneers would have tapped their feet to in 1700! \nTo purchase your tickets :\nconcertssaintcyriac@gmail.com\n418-695-5220 or 418-542-0186\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 4 June 2023 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t14:00 - 15:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://concertssaintcyriac.com/page/programmation \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tLes concerts de la Chapelle Saint-Cyriac\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tPhone:\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t418-695-5220\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tEmail:\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tconcertssaintcyriac@gmail.com\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\thttps://concertssaintcyriac.com/accueil\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Chapelle Saint-Cyriac \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n5621, rue de la Chapelle\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tLac-Kénogami,\n\n\tQuébec\n\n\tG7X 0H9\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t 418-695-5220 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://concertssaintcyriac.com/accueil \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 4 June 2023 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t14:00 - 15:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://concertssaintcyriac.com/page/programmation \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tLes concerts de la Chapelle Saint-Cyriac\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tPhone:\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t418-695-5220\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tEmail:\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tconcertssaintcyriac@gmail.com\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\thttps://concertssaintcyriac.com/accueil\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Chapelle Saint-Cyriac \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n5621, rue de la Chapelle\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tLac-Kénogami,\n\n\tQuébec\n\n\tG7X 0H9\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t 418-695-5220 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://concertssaintcyriac.com/accueil \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« Launch of the duo’s latest CD – Anguille sous roche : Something Fishy\n\t\t\tTapestry – Patisserie: A blend of Canadian musical delights »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
