    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tPURCELL : Anthems and Fantaisies\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t7 June 2024 : 19:30 - 21:15\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThe vocal ensemble of L’Harmonie des saisons collaborates with Les Voix humaines Viol Consort in a presentation of a magnificent program of English Baroque music, focusing on the sacred and instrumental repertory of Henry Purcell.\nPurcell is considered one of the most illustrious English composers of the 17th century. He was also the last composer to include viol consorts in his sacred music. Rarely heard works by his contemporaries (John Blow, John Jenkins and Michael Wise) round out this unique program.\nEric Milnes, direction and organ\nEllen Torrie and Denise Torre Ormeno, sopranos\nNicholas Burns, alto\nJeffrey Thompson, tenor\nWilliam Kraushaar, bass\nLes Voix humaines Consort of Viols\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 7 June 2024 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:30 - 21:15\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.tickettailor.com/events/lharmoniedessaisons/1193604 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizers\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tLes Voix humaines\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tL’Harmonie des Saisons\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Chapelle Saint-Louis \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n4230 rue Drolet\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMontréal,\n\n\tQuébec\n\n\tH2W2L6\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t (438) 884-3465 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://lestjeanbaptiste.com/chapelle-2/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 7 June 2024 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:30 - 21:15\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.tickettailor.com/events/lharmoniedessaisons/1193604 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizers\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tLes Voix humaines\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tL’Harmonie des Saisons\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Chapelle Saint-Louis \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n4230 rue Drolet\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMontréal,\n\n\tQuébec\n\n\tH2W2L6\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t (438) 884-3465 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://lestjeanbaptiste.com/chapelle-2/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« Stella Musica Festival\n\t\t\tPURCELL : Anthems and Fantaisies »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
