        "@value": "Date and time to be confirmed Our own “Ordres” or sets of charming, character pieces from the golden age of the French viol, that are threaded together with divers and amusing affects for your pleasure and ours!  Les Voix humaines Viol Duo Information: billetterie@domaineforget.com https://www.domaineforget.com/"
