  {
    "@id": "https://lesvoixhumaines.org/temporary/4a9774fe-54a9-4b7d-ba5c-1462ebc50166",
    "@type": [
      "https://schema.org/WebPage"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://lesvoixhumaines.org/en/evenement/bach-metamorphosis/"
      }
    ],
    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tBach Metamorphosis\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t15 February 2025 : 14:00 - 15:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tA programme celebrating both masterpieces by J.S. Bach and gems by his esteemed colleagues, each piece in a state of metamorphosis. J.S. Bach himself transformed his own compositions as well as those of his admired contemporaries. With pleasure and humility we’ve followed in the master’s footsteps creating this unique programme of our arrangements as a homage both to Bach’s extraordinary music and that of his colleagues. \t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 15 February 2025 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t14:00 - 15:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.tickettailor.com/events/lesvoixhumaines/1515847 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tLes Voix humaines\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Chapelle Saint-Louis \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n4230 rue Drolet\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMontréal,\n\n\tQuébec\n\n\tH2W2L6\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t (438) 884-3465 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://lestjeanbaptiste.com/chapelle-2/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 15 February 2025 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t14:00 - 15:30\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.tickettailor.com/events/lesvoixhumaines/1515847 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tLes Voix humaines\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Chapelle Saint-Louis \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n4230 rue Drolet\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tMontréal,\n\n\tQuébec\n\n\tH2W2L6\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t (438) 884-3465 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://lestjeanbaptiste.com/chapelle-2/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« Amour cruel!\n\t\t\tThe Chaconne – Bellingham »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
