      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tTrio Sonatas – Seattle\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t13 March 2025 : 19:30 - 21:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tTrio sonata mastierpieces by Georg Philipp Telemann, Louis-Gabriel Guillemain and Jean Baptiste Quentin le jeune with our Musica Alta Ripa friends from Hannover.\n· Bernward Lohr, harpsichord\n· Anne Röhrig, violin\n· Susie Napper, viola da gamba\n· Jeffrey Cohan, baroque flute\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 13 March 2025 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:30 - 21:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.salishseafestival.org/seattle.html \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSalish Sea Festival\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tEmail:\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tsalishseafestival@aol.com\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\thttps://www.salishseafestival.org/index.html\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Faith Lutheran Church \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n8208 18th Ave NE\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tNESeattle,\n\n\tWA\n\n\t98115\n\n\tUSA\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t (206) 523-9636 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t www.faithseattle.org \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 13 March 2025 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:30 - 21:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.salishseafestival.org/seattle.html \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\tOrganizer\n\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\tSalish Sea Festival\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tEmail:\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\tsalishseafestival@aol.com\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\tWebsite:\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\thttps://www.salishseafestival.org/index.html\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Faith Lutheran Church \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n8208 18th Ave NE\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tNESeattle,\n\n\tWA\n\n\t98115\n\n\tUSA\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t (206) 523-9636 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t www.faithseattle.org \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« Trio Sonatas – Orcas Island\n\t\t\tTrio Sonatas – Vancouver »\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
