        "@value": "Antique engraved portrait of Johann Sebastian Bach. Mid nineteenth-century engraving and print by Weger in Leipzig, after painting by Hausmann of 1735. Isolated on white. Paper indentations within the image were not removed in order to preserve the tone dynamics."
