    "https://schema.org/mainContentOfPage": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n                 \t\n\n\n\t « All Events\n\n\t\n\tThis event has passed.\n\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\tBach Metamorphosis and his colleagues\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t7 November 2025 : 19:30 - 21:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tA programme celebrating both masterpieces by J.S. Bach and gems by his esteemed colleagues, each piece in a state of metamorphosis. J.S. Bach himself transformed his own compositions as well as those of his admired contemporaries. With pleasure and humility we’ve followed in the master’s footsteps creating this unique programme of our arrangements as a homage both to Bach’s extraordinary music and that of his colleagues.\nSusie Napper and Mélisande Corriveau, viola da gamba\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 7 November 2025 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:30 - 21:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Merging Waters United Church \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n24 Rue Maple\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSainte-Anne-de-Bellevue,\n\n\tQuébec\n\n\tH9X 2E6\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t (514) 457-5819 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.mergingwaters.ca/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t+ Google Calendar+ Add to iCalendar\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\t Details \n\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\t Date: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t 7 November 2025 \n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\t Time: \n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t19:30 - 21:00\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Category: Concert\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t Venue \n\t\n\t\t\n\t\t Merging Waters United Church \n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\n24 Rue Maple\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSainte-Anne-de-Bellevue,\n\n\tQuébec\n\n\tH9X 2E6\n\n\tCanada\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t+ Google Map\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t Phone: \n\t\t\t (514) 457-5819 \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t Website: \n\t\t\t\t\t\t https://www.mergingwaters.ca/ \n\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\n\n\n\t\t\t \n\n\t\n\t\n    \n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\tEvent Navigation\n\t\t\n\t\t\t« Intergalactic echoes\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t \n\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t"
